	(text "Bottom-contact Amphenol SFW15R-1STE1LF, 1 mm pitch; numeric CSI/I2C/enable map retained.\nCamera power comes from the switched local 3.3V rail. Verify FFC current and rail response to faults.\nConfirm actual camera revision, 50–80 mm ribbon contact face/pin-1 continuity and on-camera bias."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 97.79 185.42 0)
